@api = http://localhost:5000

### Health check - expected 200
GET {{api}}/

### List assignments - expected 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Create a valid submission - expected 201 Created
# @name submit
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200383",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/USERNAME/EduSubmit-dtc245200383"
}

### Missing student code - expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/student/repo"
}

### Read the submission created above - expected 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submit.response.body.$.id}}

### Read a non-existent submission - expected 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
